{"id":"hedging","lv":"c1","n":9,"cat":"register","t":"Rào đón: seem, appear, tend to, arguably","en":"seems to · It appears that · tend to · arguably","reg":"academic","sum":"Rào đón (hedging): nói vừa đủ với bằng chứng mình có, không khẳng định tuyệt đối — kỹ năng cốt lõi của văn học thuật, báo cáo công việc, và cũng làm lời nói lịch sự hơn. Công cụ: seem / appear + to V (Prices appear to be falling); It seems / appears that…; tend to + V = thường (People tend to…); động từ suggest, indicate thay cho prove; modal may / might / could (This may be due to stress); trạng từ arguably, largely, relatively; cụm to some extent. Khi nói: I'd say…, I'm not sure, but… Rào một lớp là đủ (might possibly perhaps ✗). Seem không dùng bị động (It is seemed ✗).","forms":[{"f":"seem / appear / tend + to + V","vi":"Prices appear to be falling."},{"f":"It seems / It appears + that…","vi":"It seems that the plan is working."},{"f":"suggest, indicate thay cho prove · may / might","vi":"The results suggest a link."},{"f":"arguably, largely, to some extent","vi":"This is arguably the best option."}],"pts":[{"id":"hedging","name":"Hedging","vi":"Rào đón: seem, appear, tend to, arguably, to some extent"}],"cast":{"nam":{"name":{"en":"Nam","vi":"Nam"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"shirt","top":"#4F7CC4","topShade":"#3F68A8","accent":"#3F68A8","hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#EFC9A4","skinShade":"#DDB08A"},"x":560},"dr-lee":{"name":{"en":"Dr Lee","vi":"bác sĩ Lee"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"coat","top":"#F4F6F8","topShade":"#DDE2E7","accent":"#2E8A8A","hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1B1A"},"x":1040}},"bg":"hospital","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Our study proves that coffee causes poor sleep.","vi":"Nghiên cứu của chúng tôi chứng minh cà phê gây mất ngủ.","ipa":["ˈaʊɚ","ˈstʌdi","pɹuvz","ðæt","ˈkɑfi","ˈkɑzəz","puɹ","slip"],"who":"nam","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":3.266,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,0.554],[2,0.953],[3,1.466],[4,1.679],[5,2.053],[6,